        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/dae2a0bd6a91eda4e302aaf8da8fc1de.avif?t=1783233162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras_big/dae2a0bd6a91eda4e302aaf8da8fc1de.webp?t=1783233162 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as Hidalgo, the last free Bladewing, on a challenging, retro-inspired quest to save your corrupted friends and take down the twisted Crow Sorcerer, Omega Wing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Judanest is unraveling, poisoned by Meza, and broken by betrayal. You awaken after two years, bound to an eternal tree and armed with a demonic, talking blade that may be your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.poster.avif?t=1783233162\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.webm?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.mp4?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Platforming</strong> and Precision Gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat hordes of deadly Tengu</strong> in fast-paced, skill-driven combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, retry, grow stronger,</strong> and overcome impossible odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-acted cast</strong> and charming performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb Meza souls</strong> to unlock powerful upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Yutameta scythe</strong> and strike from afar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your weapon</strong> – Hammer, Blade, or Whip? Your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully animated opening cutscene</strong> sets the tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into the Void Crow</strong> and demolish the Tengu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vibrant world</strong> full of color and personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take flight and glide</strong> through expansive sections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect elemental powers</strong> – Flame, Lightning, and Poison!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hybrid soundtrack</strong> mixing synthwave and JRPG influences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> with expressive animation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.poster.avif?t=1783233162\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.webm?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.mp4?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic approach to video game storytelling and gameplay, and an honest attempt at trying to answer the question of &quot;what if roguelites existed in 1991 for the Sega Dreamcast?&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, precise, and rewarding platforming. Combine a variety of dashes, jumps, and sprints to reach your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the power of the Mezameta Blade to seize corrupted souls from Tengu in the heat of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash Tengu with a devastating hammer, unleash massive damage with a brutal greatsword.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike from a distance with a 'Vania-inspired whip, or hurl a deadly sickle for devastating ranged attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/7a5a3a50d19631643a9991d2b8b25717.avif?t=1783233162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras_big/7a5a3a50d19631643a9991d2b8b25717.avif?t=1783233162 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a streamlined, yet minimal loop and persistent progression, every death brings you closer to victory. Fall in battle, and the phoenix at the Twilight Perch will revive you as a stronger Bladewing,  and more prepared for what’s next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One level might have you scouring ruins for keys, another navigating vast buildings while dodging patrolling enemies, and others will launch you into the open skies of Judanest for zen-like traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone brings something new, and every challenge pulls you deeper into the heart of Judanest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take up arms against the evil Crow sorcerer who brainwashed your troupe.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You must save them all.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/dae2a0bd6a91eda4e302aaf8da8fc1de.avif?t=1783233162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras_big/dae2a0bd6a91eda4e302aaf8da8fc1de.webp?t=1783233162 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as Hidalgo, the last free Bladewing, on a challenging, retro-inspired quest to save your corrupted friends and take down the twisted Crow Sorcerer, Omega Wing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Judanest is unraveling, poisoned by Meza, and broken by betrayal. You awaken after two years, bound to an eternal tree and armed with a demonic, talking blade that may be your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.poster.avif?t=1783233162\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.webm?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.mp4?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Platforming</strong> and Precision Gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat hordes of deadly Tengu</strong> in fast-paced, skill-driven combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, retry, grow stronger,</strong> and overcome impossible odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-acted cast</strong> and charming performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb Meza souls</strong> to unlock powerful upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Yutameta scythe</strong> and strike from afar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your weapon</strong> – Hammer, Blade, or Whip? Your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully animated opening cutscene</strong> sets the tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into the Void Crow</strong> and demolish the Tengu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vibrant world</strong> full of color and personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take flight and glide</strong> through expansive sections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect elemental powers</strong> – Flame, Lightning, and Poison!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hybrid soundtrack</strong> mixing synthwave and JRPG influences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> with expressive animation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.poster.avif?t=1783233162\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.webm?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.mp4?t=1783233162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic approach to video game storytelling and gameplay, and an honest attempt at trying to answer the question of &quot;what if roguelites existed in 1991 for the Sega Dreamcast?&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, precise, and rewarding platforming. Combine a variety of dashes, jumps, and sprints to reach your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the power of the Mezameta Blade to seize corrupted souls from Tengu in the heat of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash Tengu with a devastating hammer, unleash massive damage with a brutal greatsword.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike from a distance with a 'Vania-inspired whip, or hurl a deadly sickle for devastating ranged attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/7a5a3a50d19631643a9991d2b8b25717.avif?t=1783233162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras_big/7a5a3a50d19631643a9991d2b8b25717.avif?t=1783233162 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a streamlined, yet minimal loop and persistent progression, every death brings you closer to victory. Fall in battle, and the phoenix at the Twilight Perch will revive you as a stronger Bladewing,  and more prepared for what’s next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One level might have you scouring ruins for keys, another navigating vast buildings while dodging patrolling enemies, and others will launch you into the open skies of Judanest for zen-like traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone brings something new, and every challenge pulls you deeper into the heart of Judanest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take up arms against the evil Crow sorcerer who brainwashed your troupe.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You must save them all.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "You are Hidalgo Bladewing, a bird with a beef. Hack, slash, platform, and soar through a beautifully chaotic pixel-art neonscape in your quest to save your feathered friends. Challenging retro-inspired platforming gameplay, transforming weapons, and fowl Ninja action await.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“Atomic Owl is simply a good time, with fun combat and a harsh but also somehow fair roguelite loop that encourages repeated tries even after death.”<br>8/10 – Xbox Tavern<br><br>“If you want a short, simple, and good looking roguelike then Atomic Owl is worth a go.”<br>8/10 – The Sixth Axis<br><br>“This game delights not only with its gameplay but in making you chuckle, proving that sometimes, laughter is the most vital weapon against Tengu hordes.”<br>9/10 – Game Scanner<br>",
